compileDebugUnitTestSources

Help tasks
----------
artifactTransforms - Displays the Artifact Transforms that can be executed in project ':dev-app'.
buildEnvironment - Displays all buildscript dependencies declared in project ':dev-app'.
dependencies - Displays all dependencies declared in project ':dev-app'.
dependencyInsight - Displays the insight into a specific dependency in project ':dev-app'.
